atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/ContentAndando1b.gif?t=1741968884\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A research facility plunged into chaos. In a dystopian world, a mysterious metallic substance spreads, consuming both flesh and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What was meant to be a groundbreaking extraction experiment now demands its price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/ContentZombie1d.gif?t=1741968884\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNCOVER A MYSTERY REVEALED IN FRAGMENTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Figure out the narrative on your own through documents and clever environmental storytelling.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ESCAPE THE METALLIC CORRUPTION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walls that bleed steel, unexplainable creatures\u2026 and something worse lurking below.</p></li></ul>","developers":["P. Vargas"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/3336f7a49e07fc93e54ec07723bf22c580451b2e/header.jpg?t=1741968884","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257094751,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094751/movie480.mp4?t=1741367296","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094751/movie_max.mp4?t=1741367296"},"name":"LAPSE - Official Announcement Teaser (v2)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257